<title>JAPAN: Daido Life Insurance six month parent results.</title>
<headline>Daido Life Insurance six month parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Premium income	     559.90	  vs	  581.20</p>
<p> Asset Invest Gains	 107.10	  vs	  129.50</p>
<p> Insurance Payments	 648.30	  vs	  377.50</p>
<p> Asset invest costs	  25.90	  vs	   48.50</p>
<p> Total assets		   4.94 trln   vs	    4.84 trln</p>
<p>NOTE - Daido Mutual Life Insurance Co Ltd is the full company name.</p>
</text>
